The '''Moai Statue''' is an animated [[Enemy Bases|enemy base]] introduced in [[Cats Abloom!#Spring Sprang Sprung|Spring Sprang Sprung]]. It was added in [[Version 5.10 Update|Version 5.10]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Moai Statue
|image = E 333.png
|appearance = [[Cats Abloom!#Spring Sprang Sprung|Spring Sprang Sprung]]<br>
[[Presents of Mind (Insane)|Event All-Stars Super Present DX]]<br>
[[Suffering Spring!]]
|money drop = N/A
}}

==Enemy==
This base defends itself with somewhat frequent Area Attacks that hit up to 600 range, with its poor stats being offset by extreme strength magnifications, especially when other supporting threats enter play, often turning stages into endurance battles. Otherwise, as with many other animated bases, it is essentially a normal base vulnerable to Surges and Explosions.

==Strategy==
As mentioned before, the Moai Statue can clear out groups of units that approach it quickly since they cannot hope to eliminate it in time, though its surprisingly low range (enough that a few specific units can actually damage it outside of its line of fire) allows players to engage threats beyond its reach before moving onto it.

