==Trivia==
*The Moai Statue's ability to fire energy rings out of its mouth is a direct reference to the [[wikia:gradius:Moai|Moai]] enemies in the ''Gradius'' series.
*This is actually the second time a Moai statue has appeared as an enemy in a Battle Cats-related game; the [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WAv1XVZ_d_Y first time] was in [[Kumanchu Royale]].

